# Production API URL.
#
# Default here is a relative path, which is correct when the client is
# served by the same Express server as the API (single-service
# Render / Railway / Heroku deploys — see README "Deployment" section).
#
# If you deploy the frontend and backend separately (e.g. client on
# Vercel/Netlify, server on Render), override this with your backend's
# full URL before building, e.g.:
# REACT_APP_API_URL=https://api.yourapp.com/api
REACT_APP_API_URL=/api
